- a worker-role session still cannot call the qa tools (BRIDGE_TOOL_DENIED);
- under legacy the daemon ignores or fences a presented identity exactly as it does for moe-proxy, so no legacy behavior changes;
- CQ-M07j1's seatForward relays the stamped args verbatim;
- the docs match the code.
Re-run step 3's exact command after any fix. Report every modified path in complete_step.modifiedFiles. Never commit by hand: the wrappers land the work.
